  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chindoto chia kabere chia Nebukadinesaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Nebukadinesaro agatoma amang’ana gochia ase abanto b’ebisaku bionsi, na ab’emenwa yonsi, baria bamenyete ase ense yonsi, akabateebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorembe omentekane ase more!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche narorire ng’a mbuya ing’orokie ebimanyererio na amakumia Nyasae Ore Igoro Mono ankoreire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inaki ebimanyererio biaye bire ebinene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na amakumia aye are nokobua okonene!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oborwoti bwaye nigo bore obwa kare na kare,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na obogambi bwaye nigo bogendererete ekiaare ase ekiaare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inche Nebukadinesaro nigo namenyete nomogooko ase enyomba y’ane, nkaba ngendererete goseseneka ase enyomba y’ane y’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarota okorota kwang’ondogetie; ekero naraire borere bwane, nkarora okorora gokaba kogonchanda ase ebirengererio biane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio nkarua ogochika ng’a abanto abang’aini bonsi ba Babiloni barentwe ase obosio bwane, erinde banteebie engencho ye chindoto chiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abaringoria, na abaragori, na Abakalidayo bamanyete oborogi, na abamanyete igoro ye ching’enang’eni, bagaacha asende. Inche nkabatebia chindoto chiria, korende tibanyarete gontebia engencho yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoerio oye Danieli agacha ase obosio bwane, (ere oria okorokwa Beli‐Tesasari, erieta ri’enyasae y’ane). Omoika bwe chinyasae chinchenu nigo ore ime yaye. Nkamoorokeria chindoto chiria, nkamoteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Beli‐Tesasari, omonene bw’abaringoria, namanyire ng’a omoika bwe chinyasae chinchenu nigo ore ime yao, naende namanyire ng’a obobisi tibori bore obokong’u ase ore. Chindoto narotete nachio echi, na aye ’nteebie engencho yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oko nakwo okorora narooche ekero naraire borere bwane: Nkarora omote omonene orenge omotambe mono oteneine ase egati‐gati y’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omote oria nigo ogendererete gokina, okaba ne chinguru, ogatambea gochia igoro, okarorekana ase chinsinyo chionsi chi’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amato aye nigo arenge amaya, na amatunda aye nigo arenge amaange; ase omote oria endagera nao yarenge goisanekia abanto bonsi. Ching’iti chi’orosana nao chiare konyora ekiriri chigokenderera inse yaye, ne chinyoni chikaba chikomenya ime ase chinsagia chiaye, na kera egetongwa kere moyo gekanyora endagera yaye korwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero naraire borere bwane, nkarora ase okorora kwane omorendi omochenu ogoika korwa igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agaaka eriogi rinene, agateeba: Gecha omote oyio na onache chinsagia chiaye, osose amato aye na osiarere amatunda aye; ching’iti chi’orosana chitame korwa aroro, ne chinyoni chirue ase chinsagia chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende otige egesike kere nemeri yaye ase riroba, kebe gesibire nekenyuri gi’ekioma na etai, agwo ase obonyansi oborere bw’orosana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Egesike ekio tiga kenyirirerwe ne riime rikorwa igoro, na egetari ki’omorwoti oyio kebe amo ne ching’iti chi’orosana, agwo ase egati y’ebimeri bi’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkoro yaye neonchorwe teeba eya Mwanyabaanto naende; naegwe enkoro buna eye ching’iti ase ebiro bitano na bibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okonachwa kw’amang’ana aya kwarurwe nabarendi baria abachenu, na ogochika oko nigo kwarurwe na baria abachenu. Ase igo abare moyo banyare komanya ng’a Oyore Igoro Mono nere okogambera oborwoti bwa Mwanyabaanto, naende nere okoa oborwoti obwo ase onde bwensi aranche, naende nigo akobeeka oria ore omoke mono ase egati y’ abanto agaambe ase oborwoti obwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Echio nachio chindoto inche Nebukadinesaro omorwoti narota. Aye Beli‐Tesasari, nteebie engencho yaye, ekiagera abanto abang’aini bonsi bare ase oborwoti bwane basinyirwe gonteebia engencho yaye, korende aye nonyare, ekiagera omoika bwe chinyasae chinchenu nigo ore ime yao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Danieli okoorokia engencho ye chindoto chiria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Danieli, oyo orenge korokwa Beli‐Tesasari, agaichanigwa ase ekero egeke ase engencho y’amang’ana aria, na ebirengererio biaye bikamoichania. Omorwoti akamoteebia, “Beli‐Tesasari, chindoto echi na engencho yaye, tibigoichania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beli‐Tesasari akairaneria, akamoteebia, Omonene one, naki yare koba buya onye chindoto echi nchiaba igoro y’abwo bakogechete, na engencho yaye ebe igoro y’ababisa bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omote oria kwarooche orenge omonene mono, na omotambe gochia igoro, naende okarorekana ase chinsinyo chionsi chi’ense;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amato aye arenge amaya, na amatunda aye n’amange, na ase omote oria endagera nao yarenge goisanekia abanto bonsi. Inse yaye ching’iti chi’orosana nao chiare konyora ekiriri chigokenderera, na ase chinsagia chiaye chinyoni chikaba chikomenyao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti, omote oria naye omonyene. Aye gwakinire, kwabeire ne chinguru. Obonene bwao bwakinire, bwaikire igoro, na obogaambi bwao bwaikire ase chinsinyo chionsi chi’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende aye omorwoti, ekero kwarigereretie, okarora omorendi oria omochenu ogoika korwa igoro ogoteeba: Gecha omote oyo oyosirie, korende otige egesike kiaye kere nemeri yaye ase riroba. Ogetige gesibire nekenyuri gi’ekioma na etai, agwo ase obonyansi oborere bw’orosana, kenyirirerwe ne riime rikorwa igoro; egetari ki’omorwoti oyio kebe amo ne ching’iti chi’orosana ase ebiro bitano na bibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti, engencho ye chindoto chiria neye: Okonachwa kw’amang’ana aya nigo kwarurwe n’Oyore Igoro Mono gocha ase ore, aye omorwoti, omonene one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noserigwe gochia aare korwa ase Mwanyabaanto, na obomenyo bwao nigo borabe amo ne ching’iti chi’orosana. Nobetererigwe orisie obonyansi buna eng’ombe, na nonyirirerwe ne riime rikorwa igoro, ase ebiro bitano na bibere, goika onyare komanya ng’a Oyore Igoro Mono nere okogambera oborwoti bwa Mwanyabaanto, naende nere okoa oborwoti obwo ase onde bwensi aranche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na buna amang’ana achigetwe ng’a egesike ki’omote getigwe amo nemeri, oborwoti bwao nabokoiranere ekero keria oramanye ng’a Oyore Igoro Mono nere okogamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aye omorwoti, ancha ogosemia oko kwane. Tokora ebibe, na chaka gokora oboronge; tiga obobe bwao, na ororere abagokorerwa bobe amaabera. Ande nabo oranyare komenterwa ogosesenigwa ase amatuko ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio onsi akamonyora Nebukadinesaro omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero emetienyi ikomi na ebere yachia koera, akariina kerama igoro ki’enyomba y’oborwoti agwo Babiloni, agataara aroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agaaka eriogi, akabora, “Inee! Oyo tari Babiloni omochie omonene, oyo inche naagachire ne chinguru chiane, na okobua kwane, obe obomenyo bw’omorwoti, erinde obe ogotogigwa kw’obonene bwane?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero agendererete gokwana, eriogi rikarwa igoro, rigoteeba “Aye omorwoti Nebukadinesaro, aya naro ogoteebigwa: Oborwoti bwarusigwe ase ore;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aye noserigwe korwa ase Mwanyabaanto, omenye amo ne ching’iti chi’orosana, n’obe gokorisia obonyansi buna eng’ombe. Okoore ebiro bitano na bibere goika ekero oramanye ng’a Oyore Igoro Mono nere okogambera oborwoti bwa Mwanyabaanto, na nere okoa oborwoti obwo ase onde bwensi aranche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio ring’ana riria rigaikeranigwa igoro ya Nebukadinesaro. Agaserigwa korwa ase Mwanyabaanto, akaba okorisia obonyansi buna eng’ombe; omobere oye okaba okonyirirerwa ne riime rikorwa igoro, goika etukia yaye egakina ekaba entambe buna amarionya y’ebiongo, ne chinchara chiaye chigakina chikaba buna echie chinyoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesaro okomotogia Nyasae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero engaki eyio yaerete, inche Nebukadinesaro nkarigereria gochia igoro, na obong’aini bwane bokang’iranera. Erio nkamotogia Oyore Igoro Mono, nkamobaka na komosika ere oyoreo goika kare na kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Okogamba kwaye nigo kore ogwa kare na kare,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na oborwoti bwaye nigo bogendererete ekiaare ase ekiaare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi bamenyete ase ense",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nigo baabarire ng’a nigo bare bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo agokorera emeganda ya igoro buna anchete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "akorera na Mwanyabaanto bare ase ense boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Onde tari oramotange,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gose komoboria: Ngento ki ekio ogokora?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio obong’aini bwane bokang’iranera, na obonene bw’oborwoti bwane, na obw’amasikani ane, bikang’iranera boigo. Abasemia bane, na abanto bane abanene bagaacha kondigia, na inche nkairanerigwa oborwoti bwane, na nkamenterwa okobua okonene goetania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono inche Nebukadinesaro nigo ’nkomotogia Omorwoti ore igoro na komobaka, ekiagera ogokora kwaye gwonsi n’okwa boronge, ne chinchera chiaye boigo, na abwo bare abaenenu nigo akobakeyia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
